{"seq":2,"slug":"csat-quality-monitoring","title":"满意度与质检（含会话抽查）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/cross-border-customer-service/sla-quality/csat-quality-monitoring","wordCount":3382,"readingTime":14,"html":"<h1 id=\"满意度与质检-含会话抽查\">满意度与质检（含会话抽查）</h1><p>客服团队有两类质量数据，它们的可靠性完全不同。一类是<strong>买家给的</strong>（满意度、投诉率、重开率），它的优点是来自真实体验，缺点是样本自选、回收率低、方差大。另一类是<strong>内部评的</strong>（会话抽查、质检项打分），它的优点是覆盖可控、口径统一，缺点是评的是「符合规范」而不是「买家满意」。把这两类数据混成一个「服务质量分」是最常见的做法，也是最没用的做法——因为当它们冲突时（质检满分但 CSAT 很低），没人知道该信谁。本文讲的是如何分别把它们做扎实，以及如何正确地让它们互相对照。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-满意度测-结果-质检测-过程\">核心概念：满意度测「结果」，质检测「过程」</h2><p>两者的分工可以一句话说清：<strong>满意度衡量买家得到了什么，质检衡量坐席做了什么</strong>。它们必须分开采集、分开报告，只在<strong>交叉分析</strong>时相遇。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[会话结案] --&gt; B{触发满意度调研}&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C[买家作答 / 不答]&#10;    C --&gt; D[CSAT 原始分]&#10;    D --&gt; E[回收率校正]&#10;    E --&gt; F[校正后 CSAT]&#10;    G[会话池] --&gt; H[分层抽样]&#10;    H --&gt; I[双人标定评分]&#10;    I --&gt; J[质检分 + 一致性系数]&#10;    F --&gt; K[交叉分析]&#10;    J --&gt; K&#10;    K --&gt; L{冲突?}&#10;    L --&gt;|质检高 CSAT 低| M[查规范是否脱离买家需求]&#10;    L --&gt;|质检低 CSAT 高| N[查规范是否过严 / 坐席个人风格]&#10;    L --&gt;|一致| O[确认信号]\">graph TD\n    A[会话结案] --&gt; B{触发满意度调研}\n    B --&gt;|是| C[买家作答 / 不答]\n    C --&gt; D[CSAT 原始分]\n    D --&gt; E[回收率校正]\n    E --&gt; F[校正后 CSAT]\n    G[会话池] --&gt; H[分层抽样]\n    H --&gt; I[双人标定评分]\n    I --&gt; J[质检分 + 一致性系数]\n    F --&gt; K[交叉分析]\n    J --&gt; K\n    K --&gt; L{冲突?}\n    L --&gt;|质检高 CSAT 低| M[查规范是否脱离买家需求]\n    L --&gt;|质检低 CSAT 高| N[查规范是否过严 / 坐席个人风格]\n    L --&gt;|一致| O[确认信号]</pre><p>这张图里最右边那一列是全部价值所在。一份只报 CSAT 的报表告诉你「满意度 4.2」，但它不告诉你去改什么；一份只报质检分的报表告诉你「平均分 88」，它也不告诉你去改什么。只有冲突分析才产生可执行的动作。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>满意度（CSAT）</th>\n<th>质检（QA）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据来源</td>\n<td>买家主动作答</td>\n<td>内部评分员</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>覆盖</td>\n<td>自选（有偏）</td>\n<td>抽样（可控）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>口径稳定性</td>\n<td>差（随情绪、时间波动）</td>\n<td>好（评分表固定）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>反馈延迟</td>\n<td>即时</td>\n<td>数天</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可归因到人</td>\n<td>部分（需校正）</td>\n<td>直接</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主要风险</td>\n<td>回收率偏差</td>\n<td>评分员漂移、表演化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用决策</td>\n<td>策略、政策、体验改动</td>\n<td>培训、流程一致性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"满意度-什么时候问-问谁-回收率怎么处理\">满意度：什么时候问、问谁、回收率怎么处理</h2><p><strong>什么时候问。</strong> 客服场景下的 CSAT 调研必须绑定一个明确的<strong>结论时刻</strong>，而不是「会话结束」这个模糊事件。可用的事件有三个：工单进入 <code>solved</code>、工单进入 <code>closed</code>（买家确认或自动关闭）、或一条会话在 N 小时内无来往（静默结案）。</p>\n<p>三者的取舍很实际。绑定 <code>solved</code> 意味着问得很早，买家可能还没拿到退款或没收到换货，此时他的评价反映的是「答复速度」而不是「问题解决」。绑定 <code>closed</code> 意味着问得准，但会漏掉大量never-close 的会话。<strong>推荐绑定 <code>closed</code>，且把静默结案的时间窗设得短（如 24-48 小时）</strong>，这样既等到结果明朗，又能覆盖大部分会话。</p>\n<p><strong>问谁。</strong> 一个会话里可能有多轮坐席参与（含升级、班次交接），「这条会话的 CSAT」到底评的是谁？两种做法。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>评「最近的坐席」</strong>：适合以个人为单位的绩效分析，但会让「接手烂摊子」的坐席吃亏，从而激励坐席回避困难会话。</li>\n<li><strong>评「整条会话」</strong>：公平但无法直接归因到人。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>折中做法是<strong>默认评整条会话，同时记录参与者名单与各自介入的时间窗</strong>；只在需要个人归因时，用「该坐席介入期间该会话是否被投诉/重开」这类更稳健的信号辅助，而不是直接用 CSAT。</p>\n<p><strong>回收率处理。</strong> 这是 CSAT 最大的坑。回收率典型在 5-20% 之间，且<strong>不是随机缺失</strong>——特别不满与特别满意的买家更愿意作答，中间的沉默。这意味着原始均值几乎必然是有偏的，且偏的方向不确定（取决于两极哪边更活跃）。</p>\n<p>三个可用的校正手段。</p>\n<p><strong>手段一：按结案类型分层加权。</strong> 把会话分成若干层（按意图 × 首次是否解决 × 是否升级），每层单独算 CSAT，再按各层在<strong>总体中的真实占比</strong>加权。这修正了「某一层回答问题的人多、另一层少」造成的不均衡。设层 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 的回收率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、样本均值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{x}_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7178em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、真实占比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，加权估计为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>μ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{\\mu} = \\sum_k w_k \\cdot \\bar{x}_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3521em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7178em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>而不是简单平均 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></msub><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mi>k</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_k \\bar{x}_k / K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span>。两者在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 相等时才一致——而 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 恰恰从不相等。</p>\n<p><strong>手段二：把「未回收」当成一个信号而非缺失。</strong> 回收率本身的按层分布是有信息的。如果某一类问题（比如退款进度）的回收率异常低，说明买家在收到答复后已经不再关心这次服务——这可能是好事（问题解决了），也可能是坏事（买家放弃了）。</p>\n<p><strong>手段三：用行为指标做无偏对照。</strong> 重开率（<code>solved → open</code> 的比例）、升级率、投诉率、以及主动联系次数（同一买家在 7 天内的会话数）都不依赖买家作答，因此没有回收率偏差。当 CSAT 上升但这些行为指标同时恶化时，不要相信 CSAT。</p>\n<p>行为指标与 CSAT 的关系值得单独立一条判断规则：<strong>CSAT 是结果指标，行为指标是过程指标；过程指标恶化时结果指标的上升更可能是噪音而非改善。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"质检抽查-分层抽样与双人标定\">质检抽查：分层抽样与双人标定</h2><p>质检的核心工程问题是<strong>抽样设计</strong>和<strong>评分一致性</strong>，而不是评分表本身。</p>\n<p><strong>抽样设计。</strong> 均匀随机抽样是错的，因为它把大量质检资源花在简单会话上。正确的做法是<strong>分层抽样 + 风险加权</strong>。</p>\n<p>分层维度通常是：会话时长、意图类别、是否升级、是否超时、坐席类型（新人/资深）。每层的抽样率按两个因素决定：<strong>该层的重要程度</strong>（资金相关、法务风险高的层抽得多）与<strong>该层的方差</strong>（方差大的层需要更多样本才能得到稳定估计）。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>∝</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_k \\propto w_k \\cdot \\sigma_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>同时必须保证<strong>每个坐席有最小样本量</strong>（否则个人指标不可用）与<strong>每个风险层有最小样本量</strong>（否则风险监控失效）。这两条约束会与「按方差分配」冲突，工程上的解法是：先按方差分配，再用拉格朗日式的调整把最小样本量补足，多出来的资源按方差再分。</p>\n<p><strong>另一个必须避免的偏差：只抽「有问题」的会话。</strong> 如果抽样池只包含超时或投诉的会话（因为「这些才需要质检」），那么质检分数就永远反映最差的尾部，无法用来做团队整体改进。正确做法是<strong>双池抽样</strong>：一个「风险池」（超时、投诉、升级、资金相关）做全量或高比例质检，一个「常规池」做低比例随机质检，两个池的分数<strong>分开报告</strong>，绝不混算平均值。</p>\n<p><strong>评分一致性。</strong> 质检分要能比较，前提是评分员之间一致。衡量一致性的标准量是<strong>Cohen&#39;s kappa</strong>（两评分员）或 <strong>Krippendorff&#39;s alpha</strong>（多评分员、可处理缺失）。kappa 的直觉是「扣除偶然一致后的真实一致度」：（kappa 出自 Cohen, A coefficient of agreement for nominal scales, Educational and Psychological Measurement 20(1), 1960, pp.37-46, 度量扣除偶然一致后的观察一致度，取值范围 -1 到 1，见 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cohen%27s_kappa；alpha\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cohen%27s_kappa；alpha</a> 的一般形式 α = 1 − Dₒ/Dₑ，支持任意评分员数量并允许缺失值，见 Krippendorff&#39;s alpha, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Krippendorff%27s_alpha）\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Krippendorff%27s_alpha）</a></p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>κ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\kappa = \\frac{p_o - p_e}{1 - p_e}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">κ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1408em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_o</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是观察一致率、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是偶然一致率。kappa 低于 0.6 意味着这个质检项本身就定义不清，需要改写评分准则，而不是去责怪评分员。</p>\n<p>工程实现是<strong>双人标定（calibration）</strong>：每批次抽样中有一部分（如 5-10%）被两个评分员独立评，比对结果自动算 kappa，低于阈值的评分项触发准则重写。这个流程要常态化，因为<strong>准则会随评分员的共同理解慢慢漂移</strong>，不常标定就会漂。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE qa_sample (&#10;  sample_id     BIGINT      PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  case_id       BIGINT      NOT NULL,&#10;  pool          VARCHAR(16) NOT NULL,   -- risk | regular&#10;  stratum       JSON        NOT NULL,   -- {intent, duration_bucket, escalated, ...}&#10;  sampling_rate DECIMAL(6,4) NOT NULL,  -- 该层抽样率，用于反推总体&#10;  created_at    DATETIME(3) NOT NULL,&#10;  KEY idx_pool_stratum (pool, created_at)&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE qa_score (&#10;  score_id      BIGINT      PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  sample_id     BIGINT      NOT NULL,&#10;  rater_id      BIGINT      NOT NULL,&#10;  rubric_ver    VARCHAR(32) NOT NULL,&#10;  item_scores   JSON        NOT NULL,   -- {&quot;greeting&quot;:4,&quot;accuracy&quot;:3,...}&#10;  total         DECIMAL(6,2) NOT NULL,&#10;  is_calibration TINYINT    NOT NULL,   -- 是否标定样本&#10;  created_at    DATETIME(3) NOT NULL,&#10;  UNIQUE KEY uk_sample_rater (sample_id, rater_id)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> qa_sample</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sample_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  case_id       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  pool</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- risk | regular</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  stratum       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JSON</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- {intent, duration_bucket, escalated, ...}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sampling_rate </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DECIMAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 该层抽样率，用于反推总体</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  created_at    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATETIME</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> idx_pool_stratum (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">pool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, created_at)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> qa_score</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  score_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sample_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rater_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rubric_ver    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  item_scores   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JSON</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- {\"greeting\":4,\"accuracy\":3,...}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  total         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DECIMAL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  is_calibration </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TINYINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 是否标定样本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  created_at    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATETIME</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> uk_sample_rater (sample_id, rater_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>sampling_rate</code> 落库是关键——它是反推总体的权重。没有它，质检分只能描述样本，无法估计团队整体表现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"质检项目设计-为什么-礼貌用语-不该占-30-分\">质检项目设计：为什么「礼貌用语」不该占 30 分</h2><p>质检评分表的设计直接决定它是否有效，而多数评分表有一个结构性缺陷：<strong>把大量权重给了容易评、但不重要的项</strong>。</p>\n<p>一个典型失衡的评分表：开场问候 5 分、礼貌用语 10 分、禁用词 10 分、时长合规 15 分、信息准确 30 分、问题解决 30 分。问题在于前四项总计 40 分，全是<strong>形式合规项</strong>，它们容易被评分员一致地打，也容易被坐席一致地做到——于是所有人的分都集中在 85-95 分区间，失去区分度。</p>\n<p>更有效的结构是按<strong>可区分度 × 重要性</strong>重新分配权重。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>质检项</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>建议权重</th>\n<th>是否适合自动检测</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>信息准确性</td>\n<td>结果</td>\n<td>30%</td>\n<td>部分（可对比知识来源）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>问题解决（是否真正解决）</td>\n<td>结果</td>\n<td>25%</td>\n<td>部分（可用重开/追联信号）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>政策正确适用</td>\n<td>结果</td>\n<td>15%</td>\n<td>是（可对比政策表）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>沟通清晰度与语言得体</td>\n<td>过程</td>\n<td>15%</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>流程合规（身份校验、隐私）</td>\n<td>过程</td>\n<td>10%</td>\n<td>是（可查系统动作）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>形式项（问候、签名、禁用词）</td>\n<td>形式</td>\n<td>5%</td>\n<td>是（规则可判）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表的三个判断：<strong>结果类项占大头</strong>、<strong>能自动检测的项不占用人工质检资源</strong>、<strong>形式项权重压到最低</strong>。最后一条的实践含义是：形式项完全可以由规则自动扫描（禁词表、是否发起过身份校验），既然能自动扫，就不该让评分员花时间，也不该给高分值。</p>\n<p>自动检测这一列还带来一个结构性收益：<strong>它可以全量覆盖，而人工质检只能抽样</strong>。把「客户敏感信息未脱敏」「未经身份校验就直接办理退款」这类硬规则做全量自动扫描，比抽样人工质检可靠得多——它同时解决了覆盖问题与一致性漂移问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从分数到动作\">从分数到动作</h2><p>分数本身不是产出，动作才是。三个把分数转成动作的机制。</p>\n<p><strong>机制一：分数的用途要区分与个人相关的和与团队相关的。</strong> 个人层面的质检分直接用于绩效是最容易做坏的一步——它会立刻让坐席开始表演（把精力放在评分表上看得到的项），并且让「标记条目过时」「如实上报自己出错」这些真正有价值的行为消失。更稳的做法是：个人层面只用<strong>趋势</strong>（与自己的历史比较）而非横向排名，且主要用于培训定向；团队层面用分布与分位数做流程改进。</p>\n<p><strong>机制二：CSAT 与质检的冲突要有人负责裁决。</strong> 当「质检高、CSAT 低」成规模出现时，说明质检规范与买家需求脱节，这是<strong>规范的缺陷，不是坐席的缺陷</strong>。裁决权应该在客服运营负责人，而不是在质检团队内部。反过来「质检低、CSAT 高」通常说明规范过严或某些项无法表达个人风格带来的价值，同样需要复核规范。这个机制的存在本身就是提醒：质检分不是真理。</p>\n<p><strong>机制三：把质检结果反馈成培训与知识库动作。</strong> 低分集中出现在某个意图上，动作应该是补知识库条目（对应 <a href=\"../bot-triage/faq-retrieval\">FAQ 检索增强客服</a> 的零结果簇）；低分集中在某个流程步骤上，动作是改系统设计（比如身份校验步骤太隐蔽，导致坐席总是跳过）；低分集中在某几个人身上，才是培训。</p>\n<p>这三个机制与 <a href=\"service-observability\">客服量/响应/解决监控与大促扩容</a> 的面板是互补的：那里看整体趋势与容量，这里看个体与流程的归因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>满意度测<strong>结果</strong>、质检测<strong>过程</strong>，必须分开采集与报告，只在交叉分析时相遇；「质检高但 CSAT 低」是规范缺陷的信号，不是坐席缺陷。</li>\n<li>CSAT 绑定<strong>明确的结论时刻</strong>（推荐 <code>closed</code> + 短静默结案窗口）；回收率非随机缺失，必须<strong>按层加权</strong>估计（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>μ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>k</mi></msub><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{\\mu}=\\sum_k w_k \\bar{x}_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）而非简单平均；并用重开率、升级率、追联次数等<strong>无偏行为指标</strong>做对照，过程恶化时不要相信 CSAT 上升。</li>\n<li>质检抽样用<strong>分层 + 风险加权</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>∝</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_k \\propto w_k \\sigma_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）并补足每坐席最小样本量；<strong>风险池与常规池分开抽样、分开报告</strong>，绝不混算均值。</li>\n<li>评分一致性用 <strong>kappa / Krippendorff&#39;s alpha</strong> 常态化双人标定，kappa &lt; 0.6 说明是评分准则要改而不是评分员要改；<code>sampling_rate</code> 必须落库才能反推总体。</li>\n<li>评分表按<strong>可区分度 × 重要性</strong>配权重：结果类占大头、能自动检测的项（禁词、身份校验、隐私）转全量自动扫描、形式项权重压到最低。</li>\n<li>分数转动作：个人层面用趋势而非横向排名、冲突要有裁决人、低分按「补知识 / 改系统 / 做培训」三类归因；与 <a href=\"service-observability\">客服量/响应/解决监控与大促扩容</a> 的分工是「个体与流程归因」对「整体趋势与容量」。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"满意度与质检（含会话抽查）","id":"满意度与质检-含会话抽查"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：满意度测「结果」，质检测「过程」","id":"核心概念-满意度测-结果-质检测-过程"},{"level":2,"text":"满意度：什么时候问、问谁、回收率怎么处理","id":"满意度-什么时候问-问谁-回收率怎么处理"},{"level":2,"text":"质检抽查：分层抽样与双人标定","id":"质检抽查-分层抽样与双人标定"},{"level":2,"text":"质检项目设计：为什么「礼貌用语」不该占 30 分","id":"质检项目设计-为什么-礼貌用语-不该占-30-分"},{"level":2,"text":"从分数到动作","id":"从分数到动作"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"跨时区 SLA 计时与超时升级","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/cross-border-customer-service/sla-quality/sla-timezone-calc"},"next":{"title":"客服量/响应/解决监控与大促扩容","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/cross-border-customer-service/sla-quality/service-observability"}}